window.__T__=[{"i":18840,"text":"都没什么用。\n\n那些千转万转的帖子，华丽的prompt小作文，他们团队几乎都测了一遍，结果发现能用的没几个，反而浪费了大量时间。\n\n这些提示词唯一验证的事，就是Seedance是真的不挑食，你写什么它都能生成点东西出来，但跟质量没关系。\n\n其实写一段视频prompt比想象中简单得多，只需要填好四个部分：\n\n1. 主体，就是画面里出现的主要人物。建议用图生图先出一张角色参考图，然后在即梦里新建主体，后面直接@就行，复用率极高。\n2. 场景，上传一张场景图就够了。场景图里可以带上你的主角，这样能交代角色和环境的比例关系，不容易出现人物大小失调。\n3. 音乐，这条非常重要，不要生成任何BGM，只生成对应的音效。BGM会严重干扰后期剪辑和配乐。\n4. 镜头，言简意赅地写清楚每个镜头的景别和发生了什么就行，不需要长篇大论。\n\n一个好的Prompt大概是啥样的，我也把海辛的截图放下面了。\n\n除了Prompt怎么写之外，还有一些非常有用的心得：\n\n第一，不需要往Seedance里放分镜故事板。很多人花十几分钟生成一张华丽的故事板，带镜头运动曲线带各种标注和表格，丢进去让Seedance生成，反而错漏百出。\n\n第二，Prompt不是越长越好。很多人用AI写的提示词又臭又长，里面很多都是多余的描述和情绪渲染，上传过主体和场景参考以后就不需要再用文字重复一遍了，没有意义。而且如果一段Prompt连自己都读不完，那说明你对故事要发生什么根本就不关心。\n\n第三，不要给每个镜头加时间戳，比如[0-3秒]这种东西，很多时候都是安慰剂，模型其实不会真的按时间戳来分配时长，对时长影响最大的反而是镜头的数量，所以不如用镜头01这种方式更好。\n\n第四，不要盲目追求清晰度。目前对提示词响应最好的版本是720p，不是1080p，清晰度最后定稿了用Topaz放大到4K就行了。\n\n而最最最重要的事，就是有了AI和Agent之后，我们的效率大幅提升，那省出来的时间应该花在哪呢？\n\n答案只有一个：\n构思你的分镜和故事。\n\n绝大多数的技巧，最终都会被模型的进步所吞噬。\n但相信我，你的故事。\n它不会。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNM1zAxbUAAPlkI.jpg"]},{"i":18841,"text":"（直接复制 + 替换【】）：\n生成一张高精度“角色设定板”，用于锁定同一角色的统一形象。\n基于上传的参考图或以下描述，生成完整角色设定板。所有模块必须是同一个角色，禁止脸型、发型、服装、比例发生任何漂移。\n【基础设定】\n风格：【写实3D / 动漫 / 半写实 / IP设计】\n角色描述：【填写详细描述，或说明已上传参考图】\n性别 / 年龄 / 体型：【填写】\n风格关键词：【高级感 / 科技感 / 情绪化 / 未来感 等】\n背景：纯白或极简浅色\n版式：干净、专业、技术型设定板\n要求：无水印、无Logo、标签清晰\n\n【必须包含模块】\n1. 顶部信息区（名字、身份、年龄、性格关键词3-5个、核心主题描述）\n2. 配色系统（6-8个主色块）\n3. 主身份展示（最大区域）：正面 + 四分之三侧面 + 侧面 + 背面 + 标准站姿 + 身高比例线\n4. 轮廓剪影（正面 + 侧面）\n5. 表情系统（8张）：平静、好奇、紧张、惊讶、害怕、悲伤、坚定、放松\n6. 微表情（5张）\n7. 头部结构（四分之三、侧面、仰视、俯视）\n8. 姿态变化（放松、紧张、自信）\n9. 情绪特写（胸部以上强情绪近景）\n10. 服装细节（发型、材质、配饰、鞋子）\n11. 手部动作（放松、紧张、指向、抓握、接触面部）\n\n【一致性要求】\n所有模块必须是同一个角色，脸型、发型、身体比例、服装完全一致。\n主展示区域必须最大、最清晰，作为统一参照。\n请输出完整、专业、结构清晰的角色设定板。\n\n为什么角色设定板这么强？\n先锁人，再锁图：它不是海报，而是角色的“身份证”。\n先把脸型、五官、发型、身材比例这些不可变特征锁死。\n\n适合用来做什么？\n动画 / 漫剧 / 短片主角与配角统一\n游戏角色立绘与动作一致性\n品牌IP、城市IP、文旅IP、吉祥物标准档案\n团队协作时的角色圣经\n后续生成日常装、战斗装、不同年龄版本\n\n一句话总结：\n角色设定板不是多画几张角度图，而是把一个角色从“看起来好看”变成“可以长期复用、可持续生产”的稳定视觉资产。生成后把你的角色设定板发评论区，我帮你看看哪里还能再优化～\n\n#AI绘画 #提示词 #角色设定板 #AIGC #角色一致性 #IP设计 #动画角色 #游戏立绘","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBCbUAA-5dr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBLa8AA7qaR.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBAagAA8uGP.jpg"]},{"i":18842,"text":"为【主题】设计一张 3:4 竖版“邮票式模块网格”视觉海报，Postage Stamp Bento Grid 风格。\n\n暖白色纸张背景，采用 2列×3行 的非等距模块布局，其中一个主模块占据双倍面积，其余为辅助信息模块。每个模块都拥有细密的邮票齿孔边缘、纤细描边和独立留白，但整体严格遵循统一网格对齐。\n\n主模块展示【核心人物 / 产品 / 建筑 / 主视觉对象】，使用高完成度摄影感画面或精致插画；\n辅助模块分别展示：局部特写、符号图形、编号、日期、短句、小型数据或相关元素。\n\n标题使用粗体无衬线字体，\n辅助信息使用窄体字体、微型编号和档案式文字系统。\n\n整体配色限定为：\n米白、深墨黑、砖红、低饱和钴蓝。\n\n加入轻微纸张纤维、少量油墨套印偏差和克制的印刷颗粒。\n\n整体效果应像现代设计工作室重新设计的一组限量纪念邮票，\n具有收藏感和编辑设计感，\n信息丰富但秩序清晰。\n\n避免：\n凌乱拼贴、过度做旧、花哨贴纸、无意义装饰、廉价复古感。\n每个模块只表达一个信息点，主模块最突出，辅助模块层级清楚，整体像一页可收藏的视觉档案。\n\n一句话理解：\n主模块负责吸引人，辅助模块负责补信息。它特别适合“一个主题，多点展开”。\n\n有些内容不是一张图能讲完，\n但又不适合做成长信息图。\n\n这时候，“邮票式模块网格”就很合适。\n\n因为它天然适合把一个主题拆成几个小切面来讲：\n\n一个主视觉\n几个关键细节\n一些辅助信息\n几个符号化元素\n\n最后形成一种：\n\n既完整，又不拥挤 的阅读体验。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n邮票式模块网格的高级感，不在于“像邮票”，而在于它把零散信息整理成了一套值得保存、值得阅读、也值得收藏的视觉档案。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOCgCmoaEAEne_N.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOCgCmqawAASoLo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOCgCmnacAAhoMz.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOCgCmobUAEXwKW.jpg"]},{"i":18843,"text":"Create iconic bold typography posters where words become the brand.\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a bold, high-impact typographic advertising poster for the brand [BRAND].\n\nSTEP 1 — CHOOSE THE ICON SHAPE\nIdentify the single most iconic visual object, container, or symbol instantly associated with [BRAND] (for example: a shoe for a sneaker brand, a can or bottle for a snack/drink brand, a cup for a coffee brand, a phone or device for a tech brand, a logo mark for a media/software brand, a box for an e-commerce brand). This object's outline becomes the invisible \"vessel\" that the typography will be poured into. The entire composition of words and letters must be arranged so that, from a distance, the negative space and overall silhouette of the text reads as this object or symbol — the way words can be lettered to trace the profile of a shoe, curve into the rim and body of a can, or wrap into a circle broken by horizontal bands to suggest a soundwave logo.\n\nSTEP 2 — WRITE THE SLOGAN\nWrite one short, punchy, brand-voiced slogan or tagline (4–10 words) that captures what makes [BRAND] appealing — playful, confident, and quotable, in the style of real out-of-home advertising copy (not a generic description of the product). Split it across 2–4 lines/clusters of large lettering so each cluster can occupy a different part of the icon's silhouette (e.g., the top curve, the middle body, the base).\n\nSTEP 3 — TYPOGRAPHY STYLE\nRender the slogan in extremely thick, bold, hand-lettered display type with rounded, chunky terminals — condensed enough to stack tightly into the icon shape. Each letterform should have a heavy contrasting outline/stroke (a few pixels of a second brand color tracing every letter, like a sticker or comic-book pop-out effect) and a flat drop shadow or subtle 3D bevel for depth. Letters should sit on slightly curved, undulating baselines rather than straight lines, arcing to hug the contours of the icon shape (curving upward around a rim, bulging outward around a widest point, tapering inward at a point). Match the lettering \"personality\" to the brand's actual tone: energetic and angular for sports/performance brands, groovy and wavy (70s psychedelic poster lettering) for music/entertainment brands, bouncy and rounded for food/family brands, sleek and geometric for tech brands, elegant script-influenced for luxury brands. Vary letter size/weight slightly within words for a lively, non-mechanical, hand-crafted feel.\n\nSTEP 4 — COLOR PALETTE\nUse [BRAND]'s real, official brand colors only — the primary letter fill should be the brand's dominant color, the outline/stroke a secondary brand color that creates strong contrast, and any illustrated accents (like a food ingredient, a fabric texture, a liquid splash) in naturalistic colors that still harmonize with the palette.\n\nSTEP 5 — BACKGROUND\nFill the background with a single flat or subtly gradient-shaded color that either matches [BRAND]'s dark/neutral brand color (for a moody, premium poster look) or strongly contrasts the letter colors so the typographic icon shape pops forward immediately. No photographic backgrounds, no clutter, no busy textures — just clean flat color so the lettering is the entire focus.\n\nSTEP 6 — INTEGRATE THE BRAND'S VISUAL DNA\nWhere natural, blend in one small illustrated element that reinforces the object (e.g., a cross-section of ingredients if the icon is food, a swoosh or stripe motif if it's footwear, radiating sound-wave lines if it's audio/music) directly within or behind the lettering, so the type and the illustration read as one unified graphic rather than separate layers.\n\nSTEP 7 — LOGO SIGN-OFF\nBelow the main typographic icon, leave clean negative space and place a small, simple recreation of [BRAND]'s logo/wordmark (and mascot if the brand has a well-known one) at a modest scale, centered, as a signature/sign-off — the way a poster credits the brand at the bottom rather than making the logo the hero.\n\nRENDERING STYLE\nFlat vector illustration, poster/print-ready, crisp clean edges, high contrast, no photorealism, no gradients except where specified, professional advertising-campaign quality, portrait orientation, centered composition, generous margin around the artwork, no extra text other than the slogan and the brand logo/wordmark, no watermarks, no stock-photo elements.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT\nblurry, low-resolution, photographic, 3D render, realistic lighting, extra text, extra logos, cluttered background, off-brand colors, illegible lettering, straight uncurved baselines, generic sans-serif with no personality, watermark, signature, borders/frames.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOGCGLIboAA7lZG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOGCGLPaoAAAnVy.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOGCaDGbwAAX2gE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOGCeOVaoAECmTu.jpg"]},{"i":18844,"text":"一组构图很有意思的提示词\n可以主题设置各种对象\n\n👇 交作业，记得更换主体\n\nprompt below\n\n```\n围绕任意主题对象展开暗隙窥视式广告画面：两侧用近景失焦的深色遮挡物压成厚重前景，边缘柔软、起伏、不规则，只在中轴附近留下狭长亮缝，让主题视觉载体被局部照亮并从缝隙中显现；主体放在下半段偏中位置，尺度克制但清晰，顶部或上缘设置少量由主题派生的细小附着物，形成轻微的向上节奏。背景是暖白到奶油色的背光场，四周被深咖黑阴影吞入，整体低照度、局部高亮，像隔着纸板裂口与旧实验室灯箱观看。颜色由主题自动派生：大面积暗部保持低明度、低饱和、微暖的棕黑或主题等价暗色；亮缝保持高明度、干净柔和的乳白或主题等价光色；主体使用中等以上饱和度的透明或半透明主题色，下部形成更深、更暖的沉积感，上部保留清亮、轻盈、洁净的发光层，少量高饱和点缀集中在上缘。画面叠加小型实验记录文字：左上以白色打字机感小字和细线表格构成轻量资料块，字距略松、边缘有轻微油墨破损；右侧中部放置更大的斑驳白色主题命名文字和单个数字标记，像旧标签被擦淡，只承担节奏与品牌感，不复制现成词句；主体表面可有极小的黑色编号、短线、圆章式记号。底部中央加入简笔线描小图标，像使用说明或观察者符号，线条朴素，面积很小。整体保留摄影拼贴感：柔焦遮挡、轻微压暗边框、淡颗粒与低清晰度压缩痕迹只作用于光影边缘和白字，不把洁净亮面弄脏；若暗部不形成裂缝、亮缝不包住主体、文字变成整齐商业排版，画面就失去这套风格。\n————\n你要呈现的对象：xxx\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOMbaJVaAAATW_i.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOMbShkbUAA8NZU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOMbVywa0AAAmjP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOMbYbJaEAA-ox3.jpg"]},{"i":18845,"text":"核心：\n\n生成一张3:4竖版「玻璃周末封面」高级编辑视觉。\n\n主题城市：【城市名称】\n代表建筑：【城市代表建筑】\n宠物：【宠物类型】\n宠物名字：【英文名字】\n周末主题：【周末主题短句】\n\n整体视觉参考：\n国际高端生活方式杂志封面、\n建筑设计杂志、\n先锋时尚Editorial、\n现代艺术指导作品。\n\n背景必须是：\n纯黑摄影棚虚空背景，\n无地平线，\n无真实街道，\n无天空，\n无复杂环境，\n让所有玻璃主体像陈列在黑色美术馆空间中。\n\n【核心视觉关系】\n\n以城市代表性建筑为第一主视觉。\n\n建筑占整张画面约55%—65%，\n必须具有清晰、完整、具有辨识度的建筑轮廓。\n\n将代表建筑整体重新解释成：\n透明建筑玻璃、\n高透水晶、\n光学玻璃结构。\n\n建筑依然保持真实建筑结构，\n能够一眼辨认原建筑，\n但墙体、幕墙、结构和装饰均带有：\n\n高透明度\n真实折射\n内部反射\n玻璃边缘高光\n棱镜色散\n冷白轮廓光\n轻微彩虹折光\n\n不要做成普通银色金属建筑，\n而要明显具有真正玻璃建筑的透明感、厚度和光学结构。\n\n【宠物】\n\n城市建筑前方或建筑侧前方放置一只宠物。\n\n宠物占画面约20%—30%。\n\n宠物必须从头到脚完全由透明水晶玻璃构成：\n\n头部是透明水晶\n耳朵是透明水晶\n眼睛是透明晶体\n鼻子是透明或烟晶玻璃\n身体是透明水晶\n四肢是透明水晶\n尾巴是透明水晶\n\n禁止出现：\n真实毛发\n毛茸茸脸部\n真实皮肤\n普通宠物摄影质感\n塑料玩具质感\n陶瓷质感\n\n整体像由高级水晶工匠雕刻完成的一件收藏级动物雕塑。\n\n水晶内部存在复杂折射、棱镜反光和微弱虹彩，\n但轮廓必须清晰，\n宠物品种仍然一眼可以识别。\n\n宠物保持非常安静的周末姿态：\n\n趴卧\n蜷缩\n静坐\n半闭眼\n安静望向远方\n\n不要奔跑、跳跃、张嘴吼叫或夸张动作。\n\n【构图】\n\n建筑是绝对视觉核心，\n宠物是情绪锚点。\n\n不要让宠物比建筑更大。\n\n采用强烈尺度反差：\n\n巨大玻璃建筑\n+\n较小水晶宠物\n+\n大量纯黑负空间\n\n让画面像一场关于「城市、建筑与慢生活」的艺术展。\n\n地面允许出现少量黑色镜面反射，\n形成建筑与宠物的倒影，\n但不要出现真实街景。\n\n【杂志排版】\n\n顶部使用巨大的英文刊头，\n刊头可以直接使用宠物名字：\n\n【宠物名字】\n\n采用高对比衬线字体或具有速度感的时尚斜体字体，\n白色，\n字号极大，\n允许局部超出画幅或被裁切。\n\n加入中文栏目标题：\n\n「玻璃周末封面」\n\n以及非常少量的编辑信息：\n\n城市名\n日期\n系列名\n期号\n周末主题\n一句周末宣言\n\n排版采用：\n高级编辑杂志结构\n大标题 + 极细小字\n明显字号反差\n大面积留白\n非对称构图\n微型坐标线\n细线\n极少量编号\n\n文字不要遮挡建筑主体。\n\n【色彩】\n\n限定：\n\n纯黑\n冷白\n透明玻璃\n银灰\n极微弱蓝色折射\n极少量彩虹棱镜色散\n\n整体保持黑白冷调。\n\n不要大面积彩色。\n\n【材质】\n\nPhotorealistic optical glass\nhigh-end crystal sculpture\ntransparent architectural glass\nprismatic refraction\ndispersion\ncaustics\ninternal reflection\nsharp crystal edges\nmuseum-quality glass artwork\nluxury editorial photography\n\n最终效果：\n\n不是宠物海报，\n不是普通城市旅游海报，\n不是3D建模展示。\n\n而是一张：\n\n「国际城市建筑 × 水晶宠物 × 周末慢生活」\n\n概念杂志封面。\n\n高级、安静、锋利、克制、具有收藏价值。\n\n避免：\n\n廉价3D\n塑料材质\n卡通宠物\n真实毛发\n霓虹赛博朋克\n复杂街景\n五颜六色灯光\n宠物抢过建筑主体\n普通旅游明信片\n电商广告\nUI卡片堆叠\n过多小字\n\n延伸玩法：\n城市周末系列（MISO｜东京：慢速周六）\n生活方式杂志封面\n品牌情绪海报\n个人IP栏目封面\n关键控制：\n背景必须“虚空黑”\n姿态越安静越好（趴、侧卧、半闭眼）\n只留一个破口\n刊头巨大，辅助信息极细\n\n一句话总结：\n玻璃周末封面的高级感，不在于宠物可爱，而在于它用最坚硬的材质，讲出了最柔软的慢生活情绪。\n#AI绘画 #提示词 #AIGC #海报设计 #杂志封面 #宠物海报 #编辑设计 #生活方式视觉","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOH8ZuHaIAEomkf.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOH8ZvKbAAAawe3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOH8ZuAaIAAuCVr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOH8ZuAbgAA0sHJ.jpg"]},{"i":18846,"text":"1周前我发的「角色设定板」书签破了185，今天针对视频多镜头、多模型做了升级。\n它不再只是静态立绘，而是专门把角色五官、发型、比例、服装、表情、动作全部锁死的「视频角色圣经」。\n【新增】多镜头动作锚点（3-5个关键动作姿势，标注适合视频运镜）\n\n 直接服务视频生产：漫剧、短片、游戏过场、品牌IP动画 \n多模型通用：一套板子可喂给当前主流视频工具  \n\n适合用来做什么？\n 动画 / 漫剧主角统一\n AI视频多镜头不崩脸 \n游戏角色立绘 + 动作一致性 \n品牌IP长期资产 \n团队协作\n\n生成后把你的设定板发评论区，我帮你看哪里还能再锁死～","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBCbUAA-5dr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBLa8AA7qaR.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOIlRBAagAA8uGP.jpg"]},{"i":18847,"text":"为【产品或主题】设计一张3:4竖版暗黑编辑式视觉海报，Monochrome Editorial Hero，融合瑞士国际主义排版与前沿科技品牌视觉。\n\n使用纯黑到炭黑色背景，建立隐形12列网格；画面左侧放置占据约40%版面的超大无衬线标题，字体粗重、字距紧凑，允许部分文字贴边或被画幅自然裁切。\n\n右侧偏下放置唯一的视觉主体：【产品、人物或抽象装置】，主体占画面约45%，带克制的硬边轮廓光和细腻材质反射。\n\n使用大量负空间、细线坐标、小字号技术注释、页面索引和极少量功能标签，形成时尚杂志与科技产品发布页结合的视觉感。\n\n配色限定为炭黑、冷白与一种高亮强调色【电光绿/钴蓝/信号橙】，强调色占比不超过8%。\n\n画面冷静、精确、实验性、具有国际设计工作室的艺术指导感。避免霓虹城市、代码雨、发光机器人、复杂卡片堆叠、廉价渐变和多余装饰。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n暗黑编辑式 Hero 的关键不是“多做效果”，而是控制四种反差：\n\n大标题与微型注释的尺度反差\n大面积黑色与少量高亮色的面积反差\n留白区域与单一主体的信息密度反差\n粗重字体与纤细网格线的重量反差\n\n一张画面里只允许一个主角。标题、产品、按钮不能同时争抢注意力。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\nAI产品发布：黑底＋电光绿＋抽象模型核心\n电影概念海报：巨型片名＋单个人物剪影\n潮流产品广告：银色产品＋信号橙编号系统\n个人作品集封面：超大姓名＋极简代表作品\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n主色不超过3种，强调色控制在5%—8%\n标题高度占画面25%—40%，不要小而居中\n主体尽量偏置，避免传统对称构图\n留白至少保留30%，不要把空白自动填满\n中文生成不稳定时，先生成无字底图，再进行排版\n推荐比例：社交海报3:4，网页首屏16:9\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n暗黑设计的高级感，不是把画面变黑，而是敢于把无关的东西全部拿掉。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HONzHq6aIAE7tGB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HONzHqybUAAgVme.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HONzHq3bUAAQE1O.jpg"]},{"i":18848,"text":"to image:\nPhotorealistic luxury wall-art campaign image of an ornate white peacock integrated into a sculptural botanical relief, set in a luminous ivory-and-gold color world. The hero composition features a graceful peacock perched along a twisting metallic branch beneath a sweeping canopy of golden blossom sprays and soft pom-pom-like blooms, with delicate white flowers curling around the lower half in an elegant, handcrafted decorative arrangement.\n\nEnvironment:\n• Textured ivory plaster-like background with subtle raised surface patterns and embossed organic lines\n• Large branching tree form arcs from the left side upward and across the top, framing the peacock centrally\n• Lower portion filled with flowing floral scrollwork, white blossoms, and fine curling stems\n• Avoid modern objects, clutter, hard edges, or any visible room context; keep it as a clean decorative relief composition\n\nLighting:\n• Soft diffused studio lighting from above and slightly left, revealing shallow relief depth and gentle dimensional shadows\n• Even illumination across the white surfaces with warm highlights on gold details\n• Fine shadow separation around feathers, petals, and branches without dramatic contrast\n• What must NOT happen: harsh directional shadows, blown whites, or flat lighting that loses texture\n\nMaterials:\n• Smooth porcelain-like white peacock body with subtle satin sheen\n• Layered feather textures with soft filament detail and gold-accented eye spots\n• Metallic champagne-gold branch edges and fine botanical stems\n• Dense granular golden blossoms with tactile clustered texture\n• Matte plaster background with embossed floral relief and realistic handcrafted finish\n\nComposition:\n• Front-facing, slightly elevated straight-on view of a square decorative panel\n• Peacock placed near center-right, tree trunk rising from lower left and sweeping overhead\n• Tail cascades diagonally downward to the lower right, occupying a large portion of the frame\n• Balanced ornamental symmetry with open negative space around the bird’s neck and upper body\n\nMood:\nRefined, serene, opulent, and artisan-crafted with a romantic decorative elegance\nShot straight-on in square format, ultra-detailed macro-like clarity, shallow relief realism, 8K photorealistic ornamental texture study","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2090757172300824576/img/FBZGAP_ABhSExFM4.jpg"]},{"i":18849,"text":"（直接复制)：\n\n为【品牌/产品/人物IP】设计一张3:4竖版「高信号双色品牌视觉」海报，High-Signal Two-Color Branding。画面采用电光洋红作为绝对主色，占比约75%；\n速度蓝作为稀缺强调色，占比不超过10%；\n其余使用纯黑和冷白。\n禁止平均分配颜色。使用瑞士网格与大胆非对称构图，\n超大标题从画面边缘切入，局部允许自然裁切；\n核心主体偏离中心，占画面约45%，\n带高速运动模糊、扫描轨迹或方向性拖影，\n表达野心、速度和上升感。标题使用粗体几何无衬线字体，\n数字、坐标、日期和技术注释使用等宽字体。\n加入细线坐标、箭头、序列编号和极少量数据，\n但不制作复杂仪表盘。主体采用高完成度摄影或精致3D视觉，\n避免握手、写字楼、商务会议等陈词滥调。\n整体像前沿科技品牌、潮流杂志与量化金融视觉系统的结合，\n醒目、精准、年轻、有冲击力。 核心逻辑高信号视觉靠的不是「多颜色」，而是颜色权力不平等：75%主色建立记忆  \n10%辅色制造稀缺焦点  \n黑白负责信息和呼吸感  \n等宽字体传递技术属性  \n运动图像表达品牌性格\n\n 延伸玩法AI产品：电光蓝＋荧光橙  \n个人IP：品牌蓝＋高饱和黄  \n潮流运动：酸性绿＋深紫  \n文化活动：朱红＋孔雀蓝\n\n关键控制点：\n全图主要颜色不超过4种  \n强调色面积控制在5%—10%  \n主标题最多两行  \n只保留一种运动方向  \n数据文字用于营造秩序，不抢主体  \n先确定品牌性格，再选择信号色\n\n 一句话总结真正有辨识度的配色，不是颜色多，而是敢让一种颜色统治画面。生成后把你的效果图发评论区，我帮你看主色占比和冲击力够不够～","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOSEK2XbQAAawVV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOSEK2fa0AAv86t.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOSEK2ZaQAAkfUV.jpg"]},{"i":18850,"text":"does the heavy lifting. \n\nEditorial lighting, shallow depth of field, premium colour grading, and ultra-realistic skin detail combine into a commercial-ready look.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOWJnpqbEAAQhYM.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOWJnqAb0AACtXV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOWJnpabUAABVku.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOWJnpoaUAAytRc.jpg"]},{"i":18851,"text":"为【主题 / 产品 / 工作流程】设计一张 3:4 竖版“路径叙事式3D场景”视觉海报，3D Journey Mapping。\n整体采用深海军蓝到纯黑的渐变背景。\n画面中心是一条从左下方进入、向远处盘旋上升的立体路径，形成清晰的 S 形视觉动线。路径具有真实空间厚度、柔和倒角和精密工程结构。\n沿路径依次设置 4 个关键节点：\n【起点】、【转化】、【处理】、【成果】\n每个节点用微缩建筑、设备、人物或抽象装置来表达对应阶段。\n核心产品或最终成果位于路径终点，尺寸最大，并被冷白色聚光照亮，成为全画面焦点。\n整体采用等距透视与微缩沙盘质感，材质结合哑光金属、磨砂玻璃和低反射塑料。\n主色调为深蓝、石墨黑和冷白色，仅使用少量电光青标记路径方向。\n标题使用粗体无衬线字体，占画面上方约 20% 区域。\n节点信息采用小型编号、坐标、箭头和极短标签。\n整体效果像未来交通系统、科技品牌官网与电影级3D信息视觉的结合。\n避免普通流程图、扁平箭头、密集文字、卡通玩具感、霓虹城市和无意义机械零件。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n第一，路径本身就是叙事线\n\n观众不是在“读步骤”，\n而是在“沿着路径往前走”。\n所以它天然就比平铺直叙更有代入感。\n\n第二，高低、转折、远近，都能表达信息层级\n路径方向 → 代表流程推进\n高低变化 → 代表难度升级或阶段推进\n转折位置 → 代表关键节点\n节点大小 → 代表信息等级\n终点聚光 → 代表最终结果和视觉焦点\n\n第三，微缩场景能把抽象流程变具体\n\n很多抽象概念之所以难讲，\n不是内容太复杂，\n而是观众脑子里没有“画面”。\n路径叙事式3D场景的妙处在于：\n它可以把每一步都变成一个微缩世界。\n比如：输入端 → 数据入口 / 用户入口 / 原料入口\n处理中 → 设备 / 系统 / 分析模块\n转化中 → 传输装置 / 分拣装置 / 决策单元\n结果端 → 产品 / 结果 / 成果展示\n\n这样一来，抽象流程就不再只是文字，\n而变成一组能被看懂的空间节点。\n\n一句话理解：\n它不是把步骤排成一行，而是把逻辑搭成一段旅程。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOW-MphaQAAml7i.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOW-MpiawAA8nAA.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOW-MpkaIAAx-r_.jpg"]},{"i":18852,"text":"为【人物/产品/时尚主题】设计一张3:4竖版“硬网格×软材质”编辑海报。\n\n浅灰水泥色背景 + 清晰12列瑞士网格（只露出局部细线、十字定位点、裁切标记）。  \n核心主体偏离中心，占55%，轮廓直接跨越网格。  \n主体只用一种软材质：半透明薄纱 / 褶皱丝绸 / 蓬松毛绒 / 液态乳胶 / 磨砂玻璃，做出细腻折射、褶皱、高光和轻微运动感。\n\n标题：超粗窄体无衬线，贴边并允许裁切。  \n辅助信息：等宽字体 + [01]、材质名、日期、尺寸、短标签。  \n文字只留三级：超大标题 / 中型副标题 / 微型参数。\n\n色彩以冷灰、墨黑、肤色为主，强调色（氧化铜红或酸性黄）严格控制在5%以内。  \n留白约30%，保留纸张颗粒和高级时尚摄影质感。\n\n整体像实验时装杂志 × 建筑图纸 × 奢侈品广告。  \n避开电商白底、均匀九宫格、贴纸、甜美滤镜、廉价霓虹。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n硬网格 = 理性秩序  \n软材质 = 触觉诱惑  \n主体越出网格 = 规则被打破的张力  \n工业编号 = 降低甜腻  \n材质细节 = 代替所有多余装饰\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n人物肖像：硬朗西装 × 透明薄纱  \n科技产品：精密金属 × 液态硅胶  \n东方文化：碑刻网格 × 飘动宣纸  \n美妆海报：实验室标记 × 流动膏体\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n主体只选一种主要软材质  \n网格线透明度 10%—20%  \n信息层级最多三级  \n强调色面积 ≤5%  \n软材质必须有逆光或侧光  \n中文多时先出无字底图再排版\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n真正高级的视觉张力，常常来自把最坚硬的秩序，交给最柔软的材质去打破。\n\n#AI绘画 #提示词 #AIGC #海报设计 #编辑设计 #时尚视觉 #网格设计 #材质对比","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOchuE8bsAES2IG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOchvX0bwAAkRQ2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOchvZtboAAqIl_.jpg"]},{"i":18853,"text":"分享：\n\nphotorealistic，3:4 竖幅，写实生活方式街拍，自然光趣味错位摄影，轻微冷灰绿色调，低对比，白色偏亮，轻度手机数码柔化，真实快照感。 平视机位，成年年轻女性正面居中站立，从大腿中段以上入画，身体约占画面 2/3，大拇指插兜，另外四指不插兜摆pose，肩窄、腰腹纤细，姿态放松。她的真实头脸和大部分头发被前景道具恰好完美遮住，不露五官，仅下沿露少量黑发，瓷白肌，美颜，强调上围 一只画外人的前景手从左侧伸入，拇指捏着一块透明硬质异形牌正面，其余手指从背后夹住；异形牌垂直位于画面上半部中央，与人物身体中轴精准对齐，利用近大远小完美覆盖头部和肩颈上方，形成“角色头部替换真人头部”的视觉错觉，不是头套。牌面为粉白色蜘蛛女英雄面罩与连帽半身图案，由玫红、白色、淡紫、少量黑色的亮片 / 拼豆贴片感，表面有真实颗粒闪点和透明硬边，下沿为不规则融化滴落轮廓。 服装：宽松白色短袖棉质上衣，下摆自然上卷堆叠于腰线上方露出腰腹；贴身低腰水洗灰蓝牛仔短裤，保留金属纽扣、车缝线、磨损和毛边。 背景：户外休闲餐馆门前，棕榈树叶、浅色天空、柔化红色立体招牌、条纹桌布、金属台阶；背景文字模糊不可读，不出现真实品牌。 柔和漫射日光，肤色浅暖中性，皮肤轻度柔化哑光。 清晰度：前景手与角色牌最突出，人物身体中等清晰，背景逐级柔化但可辨认。 避免：露出五官、牌子偏离头部、缩成普通手持道具、变成头套、额外手臂、畸形手指、过度虚化背景、真实品牌、水印、多余清晰文字。 右下角仅保留手写署名“nuyoah”。\n\n大家可以把里面的牌子替换成各种自己喜欢的IP来进行尝试！！！","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOe-jqubkAAcNpB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOe-jq1b0AAncgb.jpg"]},{"i":18854,"text":"Create hyper-realistic rooftop Spider-Suit portraits\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"style_prompt_name\": \"Rooftop Spider-Suit Portrait — Photorealistic Composite\",\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"identity_source\": \"Person_Name/Upload Image\",\n    \"instruction\": \"Take the face, skin tone, hairstyle, and identifying features exactly from the uploaded reference photo (or the named public figure) and realistically composite them onto the body/pose described below. Preserve the subject's real facial structure, expression style, and likeness with high fidelity — do not alter or stylize the face.\"\n  },\n  \"wardrobe\": {\n    \"costume\": \"Classic red-and-blue Spider-Man suit (Sam Raimi trilogy-style webbed design)\",\n    \"condition\": \"Pristine, complete, and undamaged — no rips, tears, frays, or exposed threads anywhere on the suit; fabric appears brand-new, clean, and perfectly fitted\",\n    \"material_detail\": \"Textured spandex/lycra fabric with raised stitched web-lines, matte-yet-slightly-sheen finish, deep red chest and limbs, navy-blue sides and legs, large black spider emblem centered on chest\",\n    \"accessories\": \"Full-face or half-removed mask optional per pose (mask held in hand if partially removed), gloves and boots fully intact matching suit pattern\"\n  },\n  \"pose_and_composition\": {\n    \"framing\": \"Medium-to-full body shot, subject seated on the ledge/parapet of a rooftop\",\n    \"pose\": \"Relaxed seated crouch on the edge, one leg bent up, elbows resting on knee, hands loosely clasped or holding the mask, head turned toward camera with a calm, confident, slightly serious expression\",\n    \"camera_angle\": \"Slightly low-to-eye-level angle looking up at subject, shallow depth of field\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4 vertical portrait\"\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"setting\": \"Urban rooftop with HVAC units, vents, and antenna structures in the midground\",\n    \"background\": \"Dense city skyline of high-rise buildings, softly blurred (bokeh) to keep focus on subject\",\n    \"sky\": \"Overcast, moody cloud cover with soft diffused daylight\"\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"type\": \"Improved cinematic soft lighting\",\n    \"key_light\": \"Large soft key light from upper-front-left, mimicking diffused daylight through clouds, gently wrapping around the face and suit to bring out fabric texture without harsh shadows\",\n    \"fill_light\": \"Subtle cool-toned fill from the right to lift shadow side of the face and suit, avoiding flat lighting\",\n    \"rim_light\": \"Faint rim/edge light along shoulders and hair to separate subject from the background skyline\",\n    \"color_grade\": \"Neutral-cool cinematic grade, slightly desaturated blues and grays in the environment, with the suit's red and blue kept rich and saturated as the focal color contrast\",\n    \"mood\": \"Clean, high-end editorial lighting — crisp highlights on suit texture, soft shadow falloff, no muddy or underexposed areas\"\n  },\n  \"photographic_style\": {\n    \"realism\": \"Hyper-photorealistic, shot-on-camera aesthetic (as if captured with a full-frame DSLR, 85mm lens, f/2.0)\",\n    \"texture_detail\": \"High micro-detail on fabric weave, skin pores, and hair strands\",\n    \"post_processing\": \"Subtle film-like grain, natural color balance, no over-saturation or artificial HDR look\"\n  },\n  \"inset_element\": {\n    \"include\": true,\n    \"description\": \"Small rounded-square inset photo in the bottom-right corner showing the real, unaltered reference photo/headshot of the subject for identity comparison\",\n    \"style\": \"White rounded border, drop shadow, placed at bottom-right corner without obscuring the main subject's face\"\n  },\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"no torn or ripped suit fabric, no visible skin through suit tears, no cartoonish rendering, no extra limbs, no distorted hands, no harsh flat lighting, no blurry face, no mismatched identity\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOfuK3AbcAA8VM2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOfuNWBbYAAudMw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOfuPsxaYAAy0lN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOfuR7faYAAUnEV.jpg"]},{"i":18855,"text":"（直接复制）:\n生成一组四格日式温情漫画，干净手绘动漫线稿风格，温暖米棕色与浅棕色单色调，柔和奶油色背景，简单柔和阴影，整体温馨治愈氛围。画面比例：正方形1:1，标准2x2四格布局，每格之间用细棕色边框分隔。顶部标题：大字「夫婦の日」，左右各加一颗小心心，手写感深棕色。\n【四格内容】\n第1格：年轻亚洲情侣站立肖像。男人站在女人身后，双手轻轻放在她肩上，两人微笑看向镜头。\n第2格：情侣坐在温馨室内，双手捧着马克杯，相视而笑。女人对话框清晰写着中文：「谢谢你一直陪着我。」白色圆角对话框，黑色清晰文字。\n第3格：情侣一起在厨房做饭。两人并肩站在灶台前，男人搅拌，女人帮忙，表情专注又幸福。\n第4格：情侣紧紧拥抱。男人低头轻轻亲吻女人的额头，女人闭眼微笑。\n【角色一致性强制要求】\n两个角色从第1格到第4格必须保持完全同一张脸、同一发型、同一服装、同一身材比例。禁止任何漂移。\n男人：短发、温和长相、穿简单毛衣或衬衫。\n女人：中长发、温柔长相、穿家居感衣服。\n【风格与质感】\n干净手绘动漫线稿，单色调温暖米棕+浅棕+奶油白，简单阴影，像日式生活漫画或治愈系插画。\n【文字要求】\n对话框内中文必须正确、清晰、无乱码、无变形。避免：写实摄影、3D渲染、鲜艳色彩、复杂背景、角色脸崩、文字乱码、廉价贴纸感。 核心逻辑角色跨图一致性 + 中文零乱码 = 终于能稳定讲故事\n\n四格结构天然适合社交媒体\n温馨日常比炫技大片更容易引发共鸣和转发 \n\n关键控制点强制写明「同一张脸、同一发型、同一服装，禁止漂移」\n对话框必须单独强调「中文正确、清晰、无乱码」\n保持单色调和干净线稿，不要加复杂光影\n四格内容节奏要有起承转合（静 → 互动 → 协作 → 亲密） \n一句话总结: 一句话就能稳定产出有故事的四格漫画系列内容，你学会了吗。\n#AI绘画 #GPTImage2 #提示词 #AIGC #四格漫画 #角色一致性 #中文对话 #治愈系","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOiMs3pbwAEY5uT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOiMs30agAA6YmI.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOiMvgxacAAsjUJ.jpg"]},{"i":18856,"text":"为【人物/服装/产品】设计一张3:4竖版“数字秀场式陈列”编辑海报，Digital Runway Catalogue。\n使用暖象牙白背景与隐形12列网格。\n画面采用非对称双栏构图：左侧放置一张占画面约55%的全身主视觉，人物或产品保持完整轮廓；右侧仅放一张局部材质特写，占画面约20%，两张影像上下错位，不做等大拼贴。\n主体位于纯净摄影棚环境，采用柔和阴天光与轻微逆光，突出【薄纱、刺绣、褶皱、半透明树脂或磨砂金属】的真实触感。保留自然动作瞬间，衣摆、发丝或轻质结构出现克制的运动模糊，像秀场摄影被突然定格。\n标题使用优雅高对比衬线字体，字号适中、字距宽松；产品名称、年份、材质与编号使用中性无衬线字体。信息只分三级：品牌标题、系列名称、微型参数。文字靠近边缘，不压住主体。配色限定为暖白、墨黑、雾蓝与一处低饱和花瓣粉，彩色面积不超过15%；\n留白保持40%以上，加入极轻的纸张纹理与摄影颗粒。整体像北欧时装目录、当代美术馆画册与高级电商的结合：安静、轻盈、具有呼吸感。避免金色奢华符号、密集商品阵列、花哨边框、甜美滤镜、均匀宫格和电商促销标签。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：全身主视觉 + 局部材质特写 + 大留白 + 非对称错位 + 克制文字。 \n\n核心逻辑“数字秀场”不是简单的大图排版，而是在控制观看节奏：全身图负责建立轮廓与气场\n局部图负责证明工艺和材质\n错位布局模拟模特依次登场\n大留白形成作品之间的停顿\n微型信息让购买界面退到幕后\n生成后把效果图评论区发我，我帮你一起优化～","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOnR583bMAAQeLp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOnR584aoAAonNC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOnR585awAAXN_e.jpg"]},{"i":18857,"text":"生活化UGC种草图。\n这个风格采用：手机原生摄影感 + 真实生活场景 + 自然混合光 + 轻微瑕疵 + 非刻意构图。\n重点不是故意把画面做差，\n而是减少过度精修、影棚布光和标准广告构图，让产品自然进入用户的生活。\n\n🎯 核心提示词（直接复制可用）\n基于上传的产品参考图，生成6张相互独立的“生活化UGC种草照片”。\n\n产品名称：【填写产品】\n目标人群：【填写主要用户】\n使用平台：【小红书 / 抖音图文 / 电商详情页 / 社交媒体】\n画面比例：4:5\n输出数量：6张独立图片，不要拼图，不要多面板。\n\n【场景设置】\n场景1：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n场景2：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n场景3：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n场景4：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n场景5：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n场景6：【填写生活场景与使用动作】\n\n每张图片使用不同的环境、机位、光线、产品摆放方式和人物动作，但必须保持产品包装、颜色、标志、文字位置和外观结构一致。\n\n【摄影风格】\n采用真实手机原生摄影感，而不是商业影棚广告。\n\n画面可以包含：\n高光轻微溢出\n阴影略微发灰\n轻微去饱和\n自然白平衡偏差\n手机自动曝光痕迹\n轻微运动模糊\n真实景深\n少量压缩质感\n不完全水平的随手拍构图\n\n【人物要求】\n人物呈自然生活状态，不看镜头或仅短暂看向镜头。\n保留真实皮肤纹理、毛孔、细纹、黑眼圈、碎发和自然表情。\n不要过度磨皮，不要网红脸，不要影棚模特摆拍。\n\n【光线要求】\n使用现实生活中自然存在的混合光，例如：\n窗外自然光与室内顶灯\n台灯与屏幕光\n正午硬光与建筑阴影\n傍晚暖光与室内冷光\n树影与户外反射光\n\n允许不同光源存在轻微色温差异，不要把光线处理得过度均匀。\n\n【产品融合】\n产品必须自然出现在真实使用情境中，例如：\n手持\n放在桌边\n打开使用\n与日常用品并置\n刚从包装中取出\n被使用过一段时间\n\n产品不要始终居中，也不要每张都正面朝向镜头。\n\n根据产品类型加入合理的自然痕迹，例如：\n杯壁冷凝水\n瓶身指纹\n包装轻微折痕\n织物自然褶皱\n屏幕反光\n瓶口少量使用痕迹\n桌面轻微生活杂物\n\n所有痕迹必须符合真实使用逻辑，不要故意做脏，不要损坏品牌识别。\n\n【背景要求】\n背景具有真实生活信息，但不能杂乱到抢走主体。\n可以出现键盘、书本、化妆品、衣物、快递盒、便利贴、餐具或儿童玩具等合理物品。\n\n禁止：\n商业影棚布光\n完美对称构图\n过度精修皮肤\n僵硬模特姿势\n虚假的用户评价文字\n伪造产品疗效或使用结果\n改变产品包装和品牌标志\n六张图片使用相同构图\n廉价滤镜感\n明显的AI塑料皮肤\n\n最终效果应像同一位普通用户在不同生活场景中，用手机自然记录产品的使用瞬间。\n\n用于公开传播时，应根据平台规则清晰标注AI生成、AI辅助或合成内容，不冒充真实买家实拍。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n真实生活场景 + 手机摄影特征 + 自然混合光 + 合理使用痕迹 + 非广告式构图。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOsw8LNaEAAQZqb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOsw8LTb0AAy5cd.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOsw8LHaMAE0TI4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOsw8LVbcAAOXEo.jpg"]},{"i":18858,"text":"（直接复制用）\n为【产品改版/人物造型升级/空间设计优化】制作一张3:4竖版“审校痕迹可视化”编辑海报，Visible Design Review。\n暖冷灰白背景+严格12列网格。画面中央放占比约65%的完整主视觉（产品界面/人物/建筑/海报），单一画布，不做左右拼图。\n在主视觉上精确叠加3处审校标记：半透明旧版轮廓、细线定位框、局部放大圆窗、修改箭头+极短批注。旧版用10%透明度灰红色虚线，新版保持清晰；通过项低饱和绿点，待改项克制琥珀色。\n右上角放修改结论（如“层级优化”“信息减负”），左下角3条微型变更记录：【问题】→【调整】→【结果】。不要长段说明。\n标题高对比衬线，批注中性无衬线，坐标/尺寸/版本号等宽。信息层级只留三级。\n主体材质真实：玻璃屏幕、皮肤纹理、混凝土/金属细节。配色限定象牙白、石墨黑、灰红、低饱和绿+少量琥珀。\n整体像设计总监审稿台+建筑校样+高端案例研究。禁止红笔乱画、密集箭头、满屏便利贴、均匀对比图。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n旧版轮廓 → 改了什么\n定位框 → 问题在哪\n短批注 → 为什么改\n新版主体 → 调整后的结果\n颜色只表状态，不装饰\n普通作品集只给答案；审校痕迹展示判断力。\n🔁 延伸：AI生图初稿精修、角色设计逐项校正、游戏UI叠影、商业海报把甲方意见变成视觉证据。\n⚙️ 关键控制：审校点3-4处，主体≥60%，旧版叠影8%-15%，每条批注≤8字，红黄绿只表状态。中文多时先无字校样再排版。\n📌 一句话\n真正专业的视觉，不只让人看到你做得更好，还让人看到你是如何判断“什么才算更好”。\n#AI绘画 #提示词 #AIGC #设计审核 #VisibleDesignReview","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOw6qiQaEAI0zAw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOw6qiSawAAE7UK.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOw6qiRbkAA_17r.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOw6qjEbkAASI6A.jpg"]},{"i":18859,"text":"根据上传的真人旅行照片，制作一张3:4竖版“旅行手账本”风格海报。\n\n保留原照片中的主体人物、姿势、服饰、景点和整体氛围，不要改变人物身份，不要改成动漫风，保持真实摄影质感。\n\n整体画面像一本打开的旅行手账页，背景为浅米色纸张，带有轻微纸张纹理、细横线和淡淡旧纸感。页面左侧加入一排清晰的笔记本打孔孔眼，让画面看起来像真实手账内页。\n\n画面中央放置一张略微倾斜的白色立拍得照片，不要出现手拿照片。\n\n重点加入“出框效果”：\n照片中的人物和主要景观元素要自然突破立拍得相框边缘，形成立体出框感。人物的手臂、腿部、帽子、头发、裙摆或身体局部可以伸出边框；景观元素如海浪、树枝、建筑轮廓、气球、路牌等也可以轻微出框。\n\n照片周围加入旅行日记式手写笔记，包括：\n日期、天气、心情、地点、旅行短句、箭头、下划线、小爱心和简短中文感想。\n\n立拍得底部白边写一个大号手写英文标题：【填写标题】。\n\n整体风格要求：\n温暖、干净、文艺、轻复古、有留白、有收藏感。\n不要水印，不要logo，不要复杂插画装饰，不要做成拼贴过满的杂乱风格。\n🔁 延伸玩法\n城市旅行版\n\n适合地标打卡、街头漫步、博物馆、老城区等照片。\n可以加入景点名、路线感想和一句旅行金句。\n\n海岛度假版\n\n适合海边、泳池、椰林、日落、度假酒店等场景。\n让海浪、草帽、裙摆、棕榈叶轻微出框，氛围会特别好。\n\n美食探店版\n\n把旅行中的餐厅、美食、街边小店做成“手账探店页”。\n加上“今日推荐”“值得二刷”“这家太绝了”这类手写短句，很容易出圈。\n\n情侣旅行版\n\n合照 + 双人旅行笔记 + 小爱心标注。\n会比普通情侣旅行照更有收藏感，也更适合发朋友圈或纪念相册。\n\n亲子出游版\n\n孩子照片、玩耍瞬间、旅行地标、轻松手写备注。\n适合做成长纪念页，也很适合打印成小册子保存。\n\n如果你最近正好在旅行，真的很适合拿一张最喜欢的照片试试这个玩法。\n做出来不是“旅游照升级版”，而是“你的旅行纪念页”。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2ODEMbMAE7F5Y.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2OIZqasAAzVK7.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2OIZra0AAn503.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2OIZwbIAA6CD3.jpg"]},{"i":18860,"text":"Movie-inspired Spider-Man images with precise face preservation, matching composition, and ultra-realistic detail.\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"generation_directive\": {\n    \"identity_source\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"The uploaded reference photograph is the sole and definitive source for the subject's identity\",\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"Preserve facial identity with maximum precision\",\n        \"Maintain exact face shape and jawline\",\n        \"Replicate eye shape and eyebrow structure precisely\",\n        \"Match nose, lips, and skin tone exactly\",\n        \"Preserve beard/mustache if present in reference\",\n        \"Retain original hairstyle, texture, and hairline\",\n        \"Keep ears and natural facial proportions unchanged\",\n        \"Match original expression\"\n      ],\n      \"restriction\": \"No redesigning, beautifying, stylizing, or altering the person's appearance in any way\"\n    },\n    \"pose_and_composition\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"Duplicate the composition from the reference photo with maximum fidelity\",\n      \"match_parameters\": [\n        \"head tilt\",\n        \"neck angle\",\n        \"shoulder positioning\",\n        \"body orientation\",\n        \"arm placement\",\n        \"wrist rotation\",\n        \"finger positioning\",\n        \"hand placement\",\n        \"hip alignment\",\n        \"leg stance\",\n        \"foot placement\",\n        \"weight distribution\",\n        \"overall posture\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"camera_setup\": {\n      \"angle\": \"elevated, downward-looking shot\",\n      \"height\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"focal_length\": \"approximately 35-50mm equivalent\",\n      \"subject_distance\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"crop\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"vertical_composition\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"perspective_distortion\": \"matched to reference\"\n    },\n    \"wardrobe\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"Outfit must match the reference exactly\",\n      \"items\": [\n        \"fitted red-and-blue Spider-Man compression suit with classic spider emblem on chest\",\n        \"light grey oversized jogger sweatpants\",\n        \"clean white sneakers\",\n        \"black backpack worn on both shoulders\",\n        \"Spider-Man mask held naturally in the left hand\"\n      ],\n      \"detail_matching\": \"Every clothing detail, color, fit, wrinkle, fold, logo, proportion, and texture must closely mirror the reference\"\n    },\n    \"setting\": {\n      \"location\": \"contemporary indoor building lobby\",\n      \"flooring\": \"polished grey marble\",\n      \"lighting_quality\": \"soft, neutral\",\n      \"reflections\": \"realistic on floor surface\",\n      \"background\": \"minimal distractions\",\n      \"depth_of_field\": \"shallow\"\n    },\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"type\": \"soft, natural indoor lighting\",\n      \"skin_rendering\": \"realistic tones\",\n      \"exposure\": \"balanced\",\n      \"dynamic_range\": \"cinematic HDR\",\n      \"shadows\": \"natural, no harsh contrast\"\n    },\n    \"rendering_style\": {\n      \"type\": \"ultra-realistic DSLR photography, editorial portrait style\",\n      \"resolution\": \"8K\",\n      \"detail_level\": \"extremely detailed skin texture, realistic hair strands\",\n      \"anatomy\": \"accurate\",\n      \"lighting_physics\": \"physically correct\",\n      \"color\": \"premium grading\",\n      \"focus\": \"sharp\",\n      \"quality\": \"photorealistic, free of AI artifacts\"\n    },\n    \"priority_hierarchy\": [\n      \"Exact facial identity from uploaded reference\",\n      \"Exact pose replication\",\n      \"Exact camera angle and framing\",\n      \"Exact outfit recreation\",\n      \"Maximum overall realism\"\n    ],\n    \"negative_prompt\": {\n      \"exclude\": [\n        \"different face\",\n        \"altered hairstyle\",\n        \"different expression\",\n        \"different body proportions\",\n        \"different pose\",\n        \"different hand position\",\n        \"different camera angle\",\n        \"different perspective\",\n        \"different crop\",\n        \"different clothing\",\n        \"different backpack\",\n        \"different shoes\",\n        \"missing Spider-Man mask\",\n        \"extra accessories\",\n        \"unrealistic anatomy\",\n        \"oversmoothed skin\",\n        \"cartoon style\",\n        \"CGI look\",\n        \"anime style\",\n        \"painting style\",\n        \"illustration style\",\n        \"blurriness\",\n        \"low quality\",\n        \"distorted fingers\",\n        \"duplicate limbs\",\n        \"AI artifacts\",\n        \"incorrect lighting\",\n        \"incorrect background\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLB0GgaYAAO7Nz.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLB0GgakAAwfK1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLB0Gra8AA4JGd.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLB0Gsb0AAX8-z.jpg"]},{"i":18861,"text":"1:\nA serene, dreamlike landscape featuring a large glowing sun low on the horizon, casting a warm red and pink hue across the sky and water. On the left, tall trees with vibrant red foliage stand atop rocky terrain, their branches reaching out and partially silhouetted against the sun. The water below is calm and reflective, mirroring the sun and trees. A solitary figure in red stands on a rocky outcrop, gazing at the tranquil scene, evoking a sense of solitude, wonder, and tranquility. The composition is balanced, with a soft, ethereal quality and a surreal, painterly style.\n\nPrompt 2:\nA tranquil, dreamlike landscape featuring a large, glowing sun low on the horizon, casting a warm red hue across the sky and water. On the left, tall trees with vivid red foliage stand on a rocky shoreline, their reflection mirrored in the still water below. On the right, a solitary figure in red stands on a rock, gazing out over the serene scene, creating a sense of solitude and contemplation. The overall composition is balanced, with soft, ethereal lighting and a calm, introspective mood.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO4-_7oXsAA2fCb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO4-3LwX0AEfnKU.jpg"]},{"i":18862,"text":"to image:\nA horizontal cinematic film strip divided into 8 distinct panels in a single row, showing a journey into a magical feather containing a Japanese landscape.\n\nStrict Style Consistency:\nBlack feather with intricate barbs, golden-beige Japanese landscape inside (mountains, pagoda, moon, trees, water), detailed ink-wash painting style, warm golden lighting, hyper-detailed, 8k resolution.\n\nPanel Sequence:\n1. Full Feather: Complete black feather with golden landscape visible inside, moon glowing, pagoda silhouette, full composition.\n2. Edge Detail: Close-up of feather's edge barbs, landscape partially visible through gaps, moon peeking through.\n3. Mountain Approach: Camera moving toward golden mountains inside feather, detailed peaks, moon larger in frame.\n4. Pagoda Focus: Japanese pagoda becoming central, wooden details, stairs leading to water, trees around.\n5. Water Path: Golden reflection path on water leading to pagoda, ripples, moon reflection.\n6. Moon Close-up: Large full moon dominating frame, crater details, soft glow illuminating landscape.\n7. Tree Detail: Golden bonsai-style trees in foreground, intricate branches, leaves catching moonlight.\n8. Inner World: Fully inside the landscape, pagoda and mountains surrounding viewer, feather edges as frame border.\n\nUnified aesthetic: black feather, golden-beige palette, moonlit Japanese landscape, ink-wash style \n\nModel: Seedance 2.0\n🎥Prompt to video⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2084756211480641536/img/7LN2wwzGmRLzmz6W.jpg"]},{"i":18863,"text":"“毛毡定格动画｜小熊穿越暴风雪  毛毡玩偶定格动画风格。  \n一只手工制作的小熊穿着红色毛衣，在白色毛毡雪原中独自前进。  暴风雪突然增强，小熊拉紧围巾，继续向前。  镜头从侧面跟随，小熊踩过柔软毛毡雪地，留下明显脚印。  它发现远处一盏温暖的小灯，于是快速奔跑。  镜头绕到小熊前方，看到它穿过雪雾，最终推开一扇小木屋门。  温暖黄色灯光照亮整个画面。  \n材质：  毛绒纤维 手工缝线 羊毛颗粒 布料褶皱  \n声音：  风雪声、脚步声、衣服摩擦声、木门声。  \n构图：  保持童话电影感。”","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2084838208047816704/img/i3WRtSIcSWQMg4Qj.jpg"]},{"i":18864,"text":"贴出来给大家参考一下吧：\n\n主题：唐风幻想+幻想风+意境感， 宏伟中式建筑，云海，远处巨型月亮，16:9画幅，极致超广角，巨物，女性人物为视觉锚点（小），白鹭，极致留白，强烈的中式色彩对比。迎客松，电影级建筑画面，纹饰简约克制，柔光色调 画面主要元素：实验性镜头角度 / 非常规构图  真实摄影质感 ，少细节","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO8XOguaQAApwn2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO8XOgdbgAAugbb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO8XOgba4AErrtM.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO8XOgrbsAAszF_.jpg"]},{"i":18865,"text":"BRAND NAME: Coca Cola\n\nUsing the ATTACHED LOGO IMAGE as the exact and only source of truth for the brand's wordmark, emblem, and color palette, create a single brand-identity moodboard image for \"[BRAND NAME]\". Do NOT redesign, reinterpret, or restyle the wordmark, emblem, or palette shown in the reference — reuse them exactly as given. The ONE new element you must design, introduced for the first time on this board, is a full mascot character (see below) — invent it once, then reuse that exact same character consistently across every panel that needs it on this board.\n\nSTEP 1 — DESIGN THE MASCOT (new, not in the reference logo):\nBased on the same brand category implied by the reference logo's emblem, wordmark, and tagline, invent a chibi/mascot-style character — an anthropomorphic animal, personified object, stylized human/robot, or creature — that most obviously and directly represents this specific brand's actual product or service. Give it:\n- A short, stocky, big-headed chibi proportion (oversized head, small simplified body/limbs), or an equivalent simplified iconic form if that better suits the category\n- Uniform thick black (or brand-dark-color) outline strokes, flat vector \"sticker\" cutout style — no gradients, no soft airbrush shading, only flat color fills plus one hard shadow tone\n- Large, expressive eyes with bold pupils and a small highlight dot, communicating an attitude fitting the brand's personality\n- A distinctive prop, accessory, or costume detail unmistakably drawn from the brand's actual product/service (not arbitrary or unrelated)\n- Colors pulled exactly from the reference logo's palette — no new colors introduced\nThis mascot must appear IDENTICALLY (same proportions, colors, props, expression style) in every panel below that features it — treat your own first rendering of it within this image as the canon version for the rest of the board.\n\nCANVAS & HEADER:\nOff-white/light-gray (#F4F4F2) background. Top-left corner: a small four-point sparkle/star icon followed by the bold black text \"[BRAND NAME] Visual\" (using the actual brand name provided, followed by the word \"Visual\") in a rounded sans-serif font.\n\nBelow the header, arrange a tight, edge-aligned collage grid of rounded-corner cards (consistent corner radius, thin gutters) split into a left column (~45% width) and a right column (~55% width):\n\nLEFT COLUMN, top to bottom:\n1. A wide rounded card filled with the brand's primary color (from the reference), containing a NEW combined lockup: the mascot character standing beside/next to the reference wordmark and emblem, reproduced exactly as in the reference image, sized to share the card together.\n2. A wide rounded card filled with black (or the reference's darkest brand color), containing the same mascot + wordmark lockup adapted to read clearly on dark (reversed/inverted variant).\n3. Two small square rounded cards side by side: the left one on a black/dark background showing ONLY the mascot's face/head as a simplified flat-outline icon (no body), the right one on the lightest palette color showing the same face icon in the dark brand color as line art.\n4. A tall photographic-style mockup card showing the reference wordmark/emblem applied to a realistic real-world product or packaging item matching this brand's actual category (a branded box/bag for food, a garment tag for fashion, a device/app screen for tech, a bottle/container for beverages or cosmetics, signage/a card for services). Professionally photographed with soft studio lighting and shallow depth of field on a neutral surface, printed with: the exact wordmark from the reference, a background pattern echoing the brand's real theme, a short 2-4 word tagline in bold caps consistent with the reference logo's tagline/category, a small illustrated version of the mascot designed in Step 1, and a small line of placeholder contact/handle details.\n\nRIGHT COLUMN, top to bottom:\n5. A large tall rounded card (spanning roughly the height of items 1+2 combined) filled with the primary brand color, containing a photorealistic 3D CHARACTER RENDER (collectible vinyl/toy-figure or Pixar-style — soft studio lighting, realistic material/texture rendering, subtle depth of field, NOT flat vector) of the exact mascot designed in Step 1 — same species/form, same costume, same props, same colors — reinterpreted in three dimensions with a matching expression. This must be immediately recognizable as the same character used throughout the rest of the board.\n6. A wide rounded card in the primary brand color showing 2-3 flat-vector illustrations of the same mascot in different dynamic action poses/expressions relevant to the brand's real product or service — identical outlined sticker style.\n7. A wide rounded card in the darkest brand color showing 2-3 small supplementary icon variations of the same mascot (alternate gestures, mini poses, or a small action icon relevant to the brand's real category) as simple flat outlined marks.\n8. A wide rounded card filled with a seamless repeating pattern built from a motif taken directly from the reference logo's emblem/theme (not a new unrelated symbol), in the same 2-3 palette colors, tiled edge-to-edge with small star/sparkle accents.\n9. Three small rounded-rectangle color swatches at the bottom right, each a solid flat fill sampled exactly from the reference logo's palette (no text or labels).\n\nSTYLE RULES FOR THE WHOLE BOARD:\n- Every panel except the 3D mascot render (item 5) must be flat 2D vector illustration with bold black/dark outlines, matching the reference logo's style exactly.\n- Zero deviation in wordmark styling or color values from the attached reference image; zero deviation in mascot design once it is established in panel 1.\n- Consistent rounded-corner radius and thin uniform padding/gutters between every card, composed as a single cohesive presentation slide, no stray white gaps.\n- Clean, professional branding-agency moodboard presentation quality, sharp resolution, portrait-oriented canvas.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9dRn9bkAAFnKM.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9dRn_akAAhwMP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9dRoKa8AAKYBm.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO9dRruakAAaA9V.jpg"]},{"i":18866,"text":"为【人物 / 产品 / 观点 / 展览主题】设计一张3:4竖版“极简杂志海报”。\n\n画面采用独立设计刊物封面式排版，整体克制、安静、前卫，具有当代编辑设计感。\n\n背景使用暖白色、灰白色或低饱和纯色，保留大面积干净留白。\n\n画面只设置一个核心主体：\n【人物 / 产品 / 建筑 / 物件 / 抽象图形】\n\n主体可以完整展示，也可以采用大胆局部裁切、边缘出画或非对称摆放，但必须保持清晰的视觉焦点。\n\n标题使用超大号粗体无衬线字体，成为画面的主要视觉锚点。\n\n标题内容控制在2—6个字，允许部分文字被主体遮挡、延伸至画面边缘，或以非对称方式排列，但必须保持清晰可读。\n\n辅助信息采用小号中性无衬线字体，像杂志封面的期号、日期、栏目名和简短说明。\n\n整体信息层级限定为：\n一级：巨大主标题\n二级：唯一核心主体\n三级：少量辅助信息\n\n使用严格的瑞士网格系统和非对称编辑排版。\n\n主色控制在黑、白、灰和一种低饱和强调色之间，例如：\n暗红、橄榄绿、灰蓝或泥土棕。\n\n加入轻微纸张纤维、油墨颗粒和印刷套色偏差，但不要过度做旧。\n\n画面要像一本由独立设计工作室制作的限量刊物封面，而不是普通宣传海报。\n\n避免：\n元素堆叠\n复杂背景\n多人物\n花哨字体\n渐变发光\n金属特效\n廉价科技感\n密集文字\n装饰性贴纸\n无意义图形\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n一个主体 + 一个强标题 + 大面积留白 + 严格信息层级。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n极简杂志海报真正的高级感，可以概括成四个字：\n少，但有序。\n它不是简单删除元素，而是让每一个留下来的元素，都承担明确作用。\n极简杂志海报不是简单地“做少一点”，而是像编辑一样，让少量元素拥有更清晰的秩序、更准确的层级和更强的气质。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPAZCLnbIAAOm1f.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPAZCLtaEAA5iSU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPAZCLnaAAAcoKX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPAZCLpaQAArWZZ.jpg"]},{"i":18867,"text":"to image 1:\nA stunning, highly detailed digital art piece featuring a vibrant orange monarch butterfly perched gracefully on a blade of grass. The composition is set against an intricate, shimmering background composed of mosaic-like silver and gold triangular shards, creating a brilliant reflective effect. Scattered throughout the foreground are delicate purple crocus flowers and slender green grass stalks, all adorned with crystal-clear, realistic dew drops that catch the light. The overall atmosphere is ethereal, serene, and magical, emphasizing a high-contrast aesthetic where the warm tones of the butterfly pop against the cool, fractured metallic backdrop. The style is a blend of mosaic art and macro photography, with precise light refraction through the water droplets. The lighting is bright and crisp, highlighting the textures of the butterfly's wings, the fine blades of grass, and the sharp facets of the background, creating a sense of depth and crystalline elegance, 8k resolution, artistic masterpiece\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:⤵️\nA faceted, low-poly style white teacup filled with steaming dark coffee sits centrally amidst a lush, triangular-geometric green grass field dotted with small, crystalline white flowers and sparkling dew drops. Behind the cup, a striking background mural displays a swirling, mosaic-inspired golden sun with textured, shimmering gold leaf details radiating outwards in concentric patterns against a stark white and silver geometric backdrop. The lighting is ethereal and magical, casting a bright, dreamlike glow over the scene. The entire composition utilizes sharp, clean polygon art aesthetics, blending nature with high-end digital design. Intricate light particles dance above the steam, reflecting a sense of tranquility and luxury. High contrast, vibrant color palette of gold, deep forest green, and crisp white, 8k resolution, stylized digital illustration with sharp edges and faceted textures, conceptual art masterpiece","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPBrhh8XgAA1YHK.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPBrkvYWEAALubo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HPBrcm1WMAAqNgk.jpg"]},{"i":18868,"text":"to image:\nA horizontal cinematic film strip divided into 8 distinct panels in a single row, showing the flight sequence of a majestic golden eagle over symmetrical mountains.\n\nStrict Style Consistency:\n\nMetallic gold and obsidian black eagle, white and gold sculptural mountains, perfect symmetry, mirror reflection on water surface, deep navy to azure gradient background, high-end 3D digital art, luxury minimalist aesthetic, crisp cinematic lighting, 8k resolution.\n\nPanel Sequence:\n\n1. Wings Folded: Eagle with wings partially folded, diving downward, talons extended, dynamic pose, mountains below.\n2. Wings Opening: Eagle's wings beginning to spread, feathers catching light, upward motion, mountain peaks in background.\n3. Full Spread: Eagle with wings fully extended (original image), soaring forward, symmetrical composition, perfect reflection.\n4. Gliding: Eagle gliding smoothly, wings slightly angled, serene pose, mountains reflecting perfectly below.\n5. Turning: Eagle banking left, one wing higher than other, dynamic turn, asymmetric but balanced composition.\n6. Climbing: Eagle ascending steeply, wings powerful, rising above mountain peaks, dramatic angle.\n7. Soaring High: Eagle at highest point, small in frame, vast mountain landscape below, epic scale.\n8. Diving Again: Eagle folding wings, diving back toward mountains, full circle motion, dynamic finale.\n\nUnified aesthetic: gold-black eagle, white-gold mountains, perfect symmetry, mirror reflection, luxury 3D\n\nModel: Seedance 2.0 \n🎥Prompt to video⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2085388119931588608/img/PFr5DkcGbnwQ06W-.jpg"]},{"i":18869,"text":"为【产品 / 人物IP / 服务主题】设计一张3:4竖版“气象式情绪景框”视觉海报，Atmospheric Mood Framing。\n画面使用开阔的天蓝色背景，主体【产品 / 人物 / 设备】位于视觉中心偏下，占画面约45%。\n四周以真实柔软的云层、薄雾或光线形成自然景框，云层只围绕边缘，不遮挡核心主体。\n上方保留约25%的纯净天空作为标题区；中部通过云层开口形成椭圆形视觉通道，引导视线落到主体；下方云层稍厚，承担视觉重量和空间纵深。\n主体采用干净的正面或轻微俯视角度，材质清晰真实：玻璃屏幕低反射、金属边缘柔和、人物皮肤自然。\n云层表现细腻体积、透光边缘与轻微空气透视，避免棉花玩具感。\n标题使用大号友好衬线字体或圆润无衬线字体，核心承诺控制在一行；副标题使用中性无衬线字体；微型信息只保留一个按钮或一句说明。\n信息层级限定为标题、主体、行动提示三级。\n配色限定为晴空蓝、云朵白、暖灰和一种情绪强调色【珊瑚橙 / 阳光黄 / 嫩芽绿】，强调色不超过8%。\n使用上午自然光，整体明亮但不过曝。\n环境必须对应产品价值：\n减压＝晴空云层\n专注＝清晨薄雾\n安全＝柔和山谷\n速度＝高空气流\n避免无意义风景、卡通云朵、复杂城市、霓虹科技光、多个设备和密集功能列表。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n😌 减压陪伴类适合：\n冥想App、香氛、助眠产品、治愈系IP、情绪服务。\n画面关键词可以用：\n晴空、柔云、呼吸感、轻透、留白\n\n🎯 专注效率类\n\n适合：\n\n学习工具、办公产品、效率软件、专注耳机、知识服务。\n画面关键词可以用：\n清晨薄雾、安静空气、低干扰、轻秩序\n\n🛡️ 安全守护类\n\n适合：\n儿童产品、保险服务、健康品牌、家庭守护型服务。\n\n画面关键词可以用：\n柔和山谷、包裹感、低风速、暖光云层\n\n⚡ 速度轻快类\n\n适合：\n物流、出行、快递、AI工具、数码设备、新效率服务。\n\n👤 人物IP海报\n\n适合：\n个人IP、虚拟形象、品牌吉祥物、内容人物海报。\n比起平铺背景，加入云层景框后，人物会显得更有“被托举”的舞台感。\n\n一句话总结\n极简杂志海报让少量元素拥有更清晰的秩序、更准确的层级和更强的气质。\n#热搜ai创作激励大赛##HOW I AI##AI创造营##德里克文的ai学习笔记#","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPFpKnYagAAXaM2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPFpNkla4AAQ2g-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPFpNkha4AAjC0S.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPFpNkibcAIvvb5.jpg"]},{"i":18870,"text":"A lone motorcyclist wearing a sleek black leather jacket and helmet, viewed from behind, riding a dark modern motorcycle along a surreal, infinite surface that blends into a vortex of light. The perspective is centered and low, creating a powerful sense of high-speed motion through a digital, futuristic tunnel. The floor appears as a reflective, dark glass-like plane streaked with intense light trails in electric blues, whites, and vibrant orange-yellow flames. The background is a brilliant, blinding point of light at the vanishing horizon, surrounded by a kaleidoscopic explosion of vertical light streaks that simulate hyper-speed travel. The lighting is cinematic, high-contrast, and dynamic, with the motorcycle's glowing red taillight providing a sharp anchor point against the chaotic, fluid surroundings. The overall atmosphere is intense, adrenaline-fueled, and ethereal, evoking themes of cybernetic speed and otherworldly journeys. Photorealistic, 8k resolution, dramatic motion blur, sharp focus on the motorcycle, intricate textures of leather and metallic components, synthwave color palette, hyper-detailed rendering. -","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPI_oHQWIAAOSZZ.jpg"]},{"i":18871,"text":"为【人物海报 / 产品海报 / 观点海报 / 展览海报 / 社交媒体封面】设计一张 3:4 竖版“巨型标题视觉锚点”海报。\n\n画面采用以下特征：\n\n超大字号标题作为主视觉核心\n标题占据画面明显面积，形成第一视觉焦点\n文字与人物、产品或背景发生压叠、穿插、遮挡或前后层次关系\n版式简洁，信息层级明确\n配色克制，可使用黑白灰、低饱和撞色或高对比单重点色\n画面具有编辑感、封面感、海报感\n留白充足，但标题有压场能力\n整体高级、利落、现代，有明确的阅读节奏\n\n可直接这样理解并使用：\n做一张以超大标题为核心的海报，标题不是辅助说明，而是画面的主角之一。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n这个词可以继续延伸出很多很实用的玩法：\n\n1. 标题压人物\n\n让大字直接压在人物前方或后方，形成封面感。\n适合人物专访、创作者介绍、IP海报。\n\n2. 标题切画面\n\n让标题跨越多个区域，甚至被裁切一部分。\n适合做更前卫、更有设计感的版式。\n\n3. 标题做节奏层\n\n主标题超大，副标题很小，正文更小。\n通过“大小反差”建立非常强的阅读层级。\n\n4. 标题做情绪表达\n\n同样是大标题，不同字重、字距、排列方式，带来的情绪完全不同。\n可以做成冷静、锋利、复古、先锋、严肃、戏剧化等不同方向。\n\n5. 适配你的内容场景\n\n这个方向特别适合你做：\n\nAI趋势解读封面\n观点金句图\n知识型社交卡片题图\n活动宣传图\n系列栏目统一视觉\n\n巨型标题视觉锚点，不只是把字变大，而是让标题成为画面的“第一主角”，用最直接的方式建立高级感、记忆点和信息重心。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPKwk20bsAAY9Kk.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPKwnjMbYAA-WGQ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPKwnjVbcAAibAn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPKwnjUasAAeLAV.jpg"]},{"i":18872,"text":"realistic suit textures + cinematic lighting + skyscraper perspective = instant blockbuster energy.\n\nPrompt: \n\n{\n  \"prompt_style\": \"photorealistic superhero editorial photo\",\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"Person\": \"Person Name/Uploaded Image\",\n    \"pose\": \"clinging to the exterior of a glass skyscraper, one arm extended overhead with palm flat against the glass, opposite leg bent and foot braced against the window frame, other arm hanging loosely, body angled diagonally as if caught mid-climb\",\n    \"expression\": \"focused, alert, looking off to the side as if scanning the street below\",\n    \"camera_angle\": \"slightly low angle, three-quarter view, shot from outside the building looking up and across\"\n  },\n  \"suit_design\": {\n    \"name\": \"Brand New Day suit (fan-original design)\",\n    \"primary_colors\": \"bright red torso/arms, deep navy blue lower body and side panels\",\n    \"chest_emblem\": \"large black spider symbol, angular modern silhouette, centered on chest\",\n    \"web_pattern\": \"fine black web-line stitching across red sections, thinning out on navy sections\",\n    \"texture\": \"red areas: matte compression fabric with raised web-stitch detail; navy areas: subtle hexagonal micro-texture, almost like body armor weave\",\n    \"trim\": \"black piping along shoulder seams, ribs, and outer arm/leg lines\",\n    \"gloves\": \"red, web-patterned, form-fitting\",\n    \"wrist_gadget\": \"black mechanical wristband/web-shooter with a small glowing blue light strip, worn on the raised arm\",\n    \"boots\": \"red with black sole trim, web-patterned, knee-high, form-fitting\",\n    \"knee_detail\": \"reinforced navy knee pads with fine textured paneling\",\n    \"belt\": \"black segmented utility band at the waist\",\n    \"material_feel\": \"high-end movie-costume quality, slightly reflective under sunlight, not cartoonish or glossy plastic\"\n  },\n  \"setting\": {\n    \"location\": \"exterior of a modern glass office skyscraper, Manhattan\",\n    \"background\": \"hazy daytime city skyline, visible landmark spire (One World Trade Center style silhouette) in the distance, soft atmospheric perspective\",\n    \"surface\": \"floor-to-ceiling glass curtain wall with visible metal mullions, faint reflection of the character visible in the glass\",\n    \"time_of_day\": \"clear daytime, soft directional sunlight from one side\"\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"type\": \"natural sunlight, slightly warm\",\n    \"direction\": \"key light from upper left, soft fill from sky ambient\",\n    \"highlights\": \"subtle rim light along the suit's edges from the sun\",\n    \"shadow\": \"soft contact shadow where hand/foot touch the glass\"\n  },\n  \"photography_style\": {\n    \"look\": \"editorial/movie-still realism, shot on a full-frame DSLR\",\n    \"lens\": \"85mm equivalent, shallow-medium depth of field\",\n    \"focus\": \"tack sharp on face and torso, background slightly soft\",\n    \"grain\": \"minimal, clean high-resolution digital look\",\n    \"color_grade\": \"natural with slightly boosted red/blue saturation for costume pop\"\n  },\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"no text, no logos other than spider emblem, no cartoon rendering, no plastic sheen, no extra limbs, no distorted hands\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLMeSPasAEJQpE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPLMeSHbEAA-dx2.jpg"]},{"i":18873,"text":"to image 1:\nAn exquisite impressionistic oil painting of a small weathered fishing boat battling through a turbulent stormy sea, rendered in a heavy impasto technique with thick, bold, visible palette-knife brushstrokes creating a tactile, three-dimensional surface. The brushstrokes are deliberately large and chunky — each stroke is a broad confident slab of paint, not fine detail. The composition centers on the boat at the middle of the canvas, surrounded by crashing waves and a dark looming sky.\n\nThe upper portion is dominated by heavy, dark, swirling storm clouds painted in aggressive sweeping strokes of deep indigo, slate grey, and muted teal, with thick raised streaks of white and pale blue suggesting light breaking through the storm. The cloud brushwork is bold and directional, conveying atmospheric pressure and movement. Each cloud is built from only a few massive palette-knife sweeps.\n\nThe sea in the middle ground is choppy and agitated, painted in varying shades of deep navy, dark blue, turquoise, and white. The white paint is applied in thick, raised, sculptural dabs to represent foam and spray of crashing waves. The water swirls around the boat in large swirling strokes, emphasizing the chaotic energy of the ocean. Each wave crest is a single bold knife-stroke, not fine blending.\n\nCentrally located is a small, weathered fishing boat with a small cabin and visible windows. It is painted in warmer tones — ochres, browns, and muted reds — contrasting strongly with the cool blues of the water. The boat is tilted by the force of the waves. The brushwork on the boat is loose and simplified, capturing the overall shape and its interaction with the water rather than mechanical detail.\n\nThe foreground is filled with jagged dark rocks rendered in bold, heavy strokes of black, brown, and deep red, interspersed with thick white and blue highlights where water splashes against them. The rocks provide a grounded, heavy base anchoring the composition.\n\nThe color palette pairs cool \n\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:\nAn exquisite impressionistic oil painting of a Mediterranean coastal harbor scene, rendered in a heavy impasto technique with thick, visible palette-knife brushstrokes creating a tactile, three-dimensional surface. The composition uses a strong diagonal: a rocky shoreline and a line of small moored wooden rowboats lead the eye from the upper right down toward the lower left.\n\nThe foreground and left half of the canvas are dominated by the sea, painted in horizontal choppy strokes of deep navy, cerulean, turquoise, and pale blue, suggesting gentle movement and reflected light sparkling across the water surface. The brushwork on the water is loose and directional, with each wavelet a separate confident stroke.\n\nA line of five or six small wooden rowboats is moored diagonally from the shore into the water, angled toward the viewer. The boats are painted in varying shades of white, cream, and dark navy-blue, showing their curved hulls and interior bench seats. The brushwork on the boats is loose, capturing the play of light and shadow on their rounded forms.\n\nTo the right and center rises a rocky, elevated coastline painted in warm earthy tones — ochre, burnt orange, terracotta, and warm brown — contrasting strongly with the cool blues of the water. Several trees with rounded bushy canopies are scattered along the cliffside in shades of olive and forest green. A tall, slender cypress-like tree stands prominently near the center of the shoreline.\n\nTwo Mediterranean-style buildings sit on the shore: a smaller white structure nestled among the trees on the left, and a larger, more prominent building on the right with a terracotta-tiled roof and light-colored sunlit walls.\n\nThe upper portion features a bright, airy sky composed of broad sweeping strokes of pale blue, white, and hints of soft warm yellow, suggesting a clear sunny Mediterranean day with light wispy clouds. The lighting is bright and consistent, with warm sunlight bathing the shoreline and buildings while the water reflects the cool sky.\n\nThe color palette pairs cool blues and turquoise of the sea against warm ochre, terracotta, and olive of the land. Blending impressionism with realism, the mood is peaceful, sunlit, and atmospheric. The background sky is a soft blurred wash of light. Heavy impasto, thick paint ridges catching natural light, no text.\n\ntext, watermark, logo, signature, photograph, 3d render, anime, cartoon, chibi, flat illustration, smooth blending, photorealistic, watercolor wash, neon, fluorescent, night scene, sunset, storm, large modern ship, yacht, sailboat with sails up, people, faces, cars, city skyline, snow, forest interior, mountains, river, lake, dark moody, black sky, single boat only","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPMNmv2XsAALI8C.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPMM7pPWgAAi1cC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HPMM6XBWYAAXJyM.jpg"]},{"i":18874,"text":"to image:\nA 9-panel cinematic storyboard layout, 3 rows x 3 columns grid.\n\nGenre: River of Time. Arc: An ancient pharaoh awakens in the modern world, battling shadows of the past to forge a new reality..\n\nUse one cohesive visual treatment throughout, guided by the reference's painterly material and surface detail.\n\nLet panel 01 introduce the uploaded reference world, then continue its location, season, color grade, and story through the remaining panels.\n\nWhen the brief includes a recurring character or animal, keep its identity and appearance consistent across the sequence. Do not invent extra bystanders.\n\nWorld card: natural environment only - landscapes, water, sky, plants, wildlife, seasons, and natural light. Keep physical motion plausible and preserve the reference's medium, palette, light, and texture.\n\nLighting: cool moonlight through mist, silver-blue night atmosphere, soft glow. Camera: energetic tracking shot following the subject with readable speed and direction. Mood: energetic forward momentum, active movement, vivid physical action.\n\nTone: energetic, vivid, and forward-moving.\n\nENERGY DIRECTIVE: every panel shows decisive action, speed, force or impact. Use strong verbs, acceleration, readable motion blur and debris; no passive drifting.\n\nPanel 01: The camera aggressively zooms into the pharaoh's face, his eyes igniting with golden light as particles of golden dust begin to swirl around him. Frame: bold wide action frame with strong leading lines and immediate momentum.\n\nPanel 02: The pharaoh sharply turns his head, his gaze fixed forward through fracturing visions of ancient pyramids and modern metropolises, creating a sense of clashing worlds. Frame: dynamic mid-shot with diagonal energy and visible motion blur.\n\nPanel 03: The camera rapidly tracks the pharaoh as he lunges forward, striking at an unseen threat, leaving a trail of golden light, with spectral battle imagery flashing by. Frame: tight impact close-up at the peak of the movement.\n\nPanel 04: The camera makes a sharp orbit around the pharaoh, showing him at the center of a raging vortex of sand, gold coins, and fragments of ancient artifacts, symbolizing the chaos of time. Frame: low or high angle chase framing with speed cues in the foreground.\n\nPanel 05: The pharaoh punches through a wall of light and shadow, tearing the fabric of reality, his figure instantly moving forward, leaving only shimmering particles behind. Frame: sweeping high-energy reveal of the full arena of action.\n\nPanel 06: The camera rapidly zooms into the pharaoh's face, his eyes still glowing, but now reflecting a calm new, unknown world, hinting at the battle's end. Frame: dynamic mid-shot with diagonal energy and visible motion blur.\n\nPanel 07: The shadow of a giant, spectral opponent momentarily engulfs the pharaoh, creating tension and hinting the fight is not over, before dissipating. Frame: tight impact close-up at the peak of the movement.\n\nPanel 08: The camera moves rapidly, showing the golden particles from the battle slowly settling like dust against a dark, but now more stable, sky. Frame: low or high angle chase framing with speed cues in the foreground.\n\nPanel 09: The pharaoh raises his hand, emitting a soft golden light that illuminates a small area around him, symbolizing acceptance of the new reality and finding peace. Frame: decisive power frame landing the final beat with force.\n\nLayout: Thin black borders, numbers 01-09 in corners, consistent color grading and lighting.\n\n🎥Prompt to video⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2086210651693756416/img/XPxGmzCqdd9x7NKv.jpg"]},{"i":18875,"text":"分享：\n30秒，16:9横版，完整采用顶级法国奢侈品牌广告式视觉语言：极简高级、法式克制、马术隐喻、雕塑感影棚布光、橙色品牌气质、超慢动作材质特写、优雅而略带荒诞的高级幽默。\n广告主角不是皮革，不是丝巾，而是一只最普通、最廉价的半透明橙色塑料袋。\n整支影片必须认真、庄重地对待这只塑料袋，绝不拍成搞笑短剧。越高级、越克制，反差越强。\n音乐使用极简法式实验配乐：低沉大提琴、轻微皮革摩擦般的打击音、空气感电子音、马蹄节奏采样。没有旁白，主要依靠画面和极少量文字完成表达。\n\n【视觉控制】\n全片不要使用廉价广告灯光，不要街头塑料袋纪实感，不要喜剧表演，不要夸张搞怪。\n\n【摄影风格】\n\n法国高级时装广告；\n顶级奢侈品静物摄影；\n35mm与85mm电影镜头结合；\n大量100mm微距材质特写；\n极浅景深；\n极慢推镜；\n超慢动作；\n大面积负空间；\n极度克制的剪辑。\n\n核心色彩只有：\n\n深黑；\n橙；\n暖棕；\n象牙白；\n极少量金属银。\n\n禁止出现霓虹灯、赛博朋克、科技UI、过度粒子、廉价金色光效。\n\n整支广告的核心气质：\n\n“我们明明只是在拍一只塑料袋，\n但所有人都必须相信，\n这可能是世界上最值得被认真观看的一只塑料袋。””","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2086273893053169664/img/c1bx99GD1ZOGvosq.jpg"]},{"i":18876,"text":"为【产品 / 界面 / 机械装置 / 角色设定 / 品牌系统】设计一张3:4竖版“组件解剖式展开”科技编辑海报。\n整体采用暖灰白背景与严格12列网格，画面具有清晰的结构秩序、成熟的系统感和科技编辑设计气质。\n中央放置一个完成度最高的核心主体，占画面约45%，先完整展示它的最终形态。\n然后将这个主体拆解为5—7个关键组件，沿同一个方向依次悬浮展开，建议沿右上对角线、垂直方向或单一水平路径展开。\n所有组件必须保持相同透视角度、统一光线方向和一致材质逻辑，并通过纤细引导线、定位点、编号和短标签连接，明确展示“整体—模块—细节”的从属关系。\n主体与组件需具备真实厚度、圆角、接口、结构边缘和柔和接触阴影。\n材质方向可采用：\n低反射玻璃、阳极氧化铝、磨砂塑料、喷砂金属、半透明亚克力、柔和橡胶等。\n标题使用粗体几何无衬线字体；\n组件名称使用中性无衬线字体；\n尺寸、状态、版本号、令牌和参数使用等宽字体。\n信息层级只保留三级：\n一级：主标题\n二级：组件标签\n三级：微型参数\n配色限定为：\n骨白、石墨黑、冷灰，加一种系统强调色【钴蓝 / 酸性绿 / 信号橙】。\n强调色只用于关键组件、节点、状态或重点说明，占比不超过8%。\n整体要像工业产品爆炸图、成熟设计系统文档和高端科技杂志封面的结合。\n避免：\n复杂仪表盘\n密集箭头\n均匀卡片阵列\n霓虹光效\n随机碎片\n过多装饰零件\n无法组装的假结构\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n一个完整主体 + 5到7个展开组件 + 引导线编号 + 单一强调色 + 清晰层级。\n\n组件解剖式展开的高级感，不在于把东西拆开，而在于让观众既看到完整结果，也真正看懂每个部分为什么存在。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPQ9no8bsAAVq3c.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPQ9no_aQAEopWU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPQ9nscacAAshko.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPQ9nskawAATuMs.jpg"]},{"i":18877,"text":"to image 1:\nOil painting of a butterfly resting on a golden wheat stalk at sunrise, \nwarm backlit sunlight glowing through misty wheat field, soft golden \nhour lighting, delicate detailed butterfly wings with orange, black \nand green patterns, dew droplets sparkling like bokeh, blurred hazy \nbackground with silhouetted trees, tall wheat ears in foreground with \nfine visible brush texture, warm color palette of gold, amber and \nsoft green, romantic atmospheric mood, classical fine art painting \nstyle, vertical composition, shallow depth of field, cinematic light rays\n\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPREUx3WUAAkiN1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPRHhwVXsAAkc9M.jpg"]},{"i":18878,"text":"很适合各种企事业，地产之类公司，常规海报的一组提示词\n\n可以自由安排画面内容，解锁各种可能性\n\n样张四张全是这组元提示词+佐料而来。\n\n提示词：\n\n```\n围绕任意主题对象生成极简商务展会海报。画面采用橄榄绿至草绿色的软调温和单色系背景，辅以淡雅纸张微纹理与柔和环境光影。下半部分采用精细线描手绘结合淡描影调方式呈现城市天际线建筑剪影群，左侧与右侧前景建筑突出拉高，中间以层次渐远的中远景轮廓衬托，勾勒出极具层次感与空间纵深的地标化建筑背景。上半部分留出大面积呼吸感负空间，上方居中布置超大字号亮白无衬线粗体数字与关键展位号/核心主题标识，上下错落排布微型图标（如时钟、定位指针）、辅助小字号英文及中文信息行。右侧边缘纵向贯穿大字号半透明浅绿无衬线水印文字，形成右侧视觉锚定。整体字形清晰规整，文字层级极具秩序感，线描建筑与柔和单色基调完美融合，呈现现代化、高品质且典雅干练的展会邀请函视觉气韵。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSOl7Tb0AA5NZ-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSOl7ObsAEPDL1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSOmSeagAAnyCn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSOorAaoAAv7aM.jpg"]},{"i":18879,"text":"发给H3：\n【参考图规则】  \n@图片1 是最终漆线雕作品的唯一权威参考。 必须严格保持图片1中的作品造型、主体比例、漆面颜色、金色漆线纹样、纹样走向、器型和整体气质。 不得随意增加龙、凤、佛像、文字或不存在的装饰。 \n @图片2 是包装盒、包装纸、品牌标识以及产品标签的唯一权威参考。 所有包装结构、颜色和标识均按照图片2执行。  \n@图片3 是厦门传统漆线雕工作室的环境与工匠服装参考。 保持真实闽南手工作坊质感，不做古装影视化处理，不制造虚假的“古代作坊”。  \n\n【目标】  制作一支15秒、9:16竖版的厦门漆线雕非遗工艺短片。  主题：  “一根线，走完三百年的手艺。”  影片完整呈现：  备料 → 舂打漆线土 → 搓线 → 盘线成纹 → 安金 → 贴金 → 清理完成 → 包装 → 上架  快速剪辑， 字幕驱动， 即使完全静音观看也能理解整个制作过程。  视觉采用真实高端人文纪录广告摄影：  35毫米胶片电影质感， 细腻颗粒， 浅景深， 大量微距， 自然手持， 运动非常克制， 不做旅游宣传片， 不做华丽国潮特效， 不做博物馆宣传片。  重点永远是：  手， 线， 漆， 金箔， 纹样， 时间。   \n\n【金色就是时间】  整支影片必须存在一条不可逆的视觉变化：  画面中的“金色”从无到有，并越来越多。  影片开始：  只有黑、 深褐、 砖灰、 暗红， 几乎看不到金色。  漆线开始盘绕以后， 画面出现第一点暖金。  贴金以后， 金色迅速扩大。  作品完成时， 精细金色纹样覆盖主体。  最后上架时， 整个作品被温暖自然光照亮。  每一个镜头都必须比前一个镜头拥有更多的金色。  这个变化不能倒退。  金色就是这支影片的时间。\n   \n【固定字幕牌】  整个影片始终只有一个字幕牌。  位置：  画面下方三分之一， 水平居中， 所有镜头完全相同的位置。  造型：  非常克制的小型圆角矩形， 深朱砂红底， 暖米白文字。  两行文字：  第一行： 较细字体， 显示“工序”。  第二行： 粗体， 显示一句极短的动作描述。  字幕牌：  不移动， 不放大， 不缩小， 不淡入淡出， 不跳动。  只在指定剪辑点瞬间更换文字。  字体必须清楚、正确。   \n\n【镜头序列】 \n 0—1.7秒  主镜头。  深夜般昏暗的传统工作台。  一盏暖色工作灯只照亮双手。  桌面上可以看到：  陈年砖粉质感的细粉、 深色大漆材料、 正在被反复捶打揉合的深褐色漆线土。  工匠双手将材料反复捶、压、揉， 逐渐形成柔软、富有韧性的泥团。  周围环境全部沉入黑暗。  没有金色。  字幕：  “第一道” “捶土成线”   \n1.7—3.3秒  极端微距。  一小块漆线土放在传统搓线板之间。  工匠双手稳定向前推动搓板。  原本粗厚的泥条逐渐被搓成长而均匀的细线。  摄影机贴得非常近。  能够清楚看到：  漆线轻微湿润的表面， 细小纹理， 手指压力， 线条被不断拉细。  背景完全虚化。  字幕保持：  “第一道” “捶土成线”  \n 3.3—5.0秒  主镜头。  朱红漆面的器物坯体第一次出现。  工匠用极细工具， 将刚刚搓好的柔软漆线轻轻落在器物表面。  第一根漆线贴上去。  只有一根。  然后第二根。  线条开始形成第一个小小的卷云纹。  画面第一次出现非常微弱的暖色高光。  字幕：  “第二道” “一线起纹”  \n 5.0—6.8秒  微距插入镜头。  镜头几乎贴着器物表面横向观察。  工匠用竹制细工具推动漆线：  盘， 绕， 结， 堆。  几根不足毫米级视觉尺度的柔软漆线， 逐渐形成具有明显高度差的浮凸纹样。  线条之间非常紧密。  卷云、缠枝、如意形态逐渐出现。  重点展示：  线并不是画上去的，  而是真正一根一根盘出来的。  字幕保持：  “第二道” “一线起纹”  \n6.8—8.6秒  主镜头。  器物已经完成大部分漆线纹样。  摄影机非常缓慢地向前推近。  工匠旋转器物。  光线擦过密集漆线表面。  能够看到：  高低起伏， 盘绕结构， 层层叠叠的线性浮雕。  这时依然没有真正的金箔。  只有漆线自身的暖棕色。  字幕：  “第三道” “盘线成雕”   \n8.6—10.2秒  全片最重要的声音与视觉高潮。  极端微距。  一张极薄金箔悬在空气里轻微颤动。  几乎没有重量。  工匠屏住动作， 用传统工具将金箔缓缓落向已经完成的漆线纹样。  金箔接触表面的瞬间，  贴住。  镜头保持。  不要快速切走。  细小金箔自然贴合漆线的高低起伏， 金色第一次大面积出现。  字幕：  “第四道” “一片金落下”   \n10.2—11.7秒  微距。  柔软毛刷轻轻扫过作品表面。  多余金箔碎屑被一点点扫开。  随着刷毛经过，  清晰、 锐利、 细密的金色漆线纹样从杂乱金箔中显现。  这是第二个视觉高潮。  镜头必须清楚表现：  杂乱金箔  变成  精确金色纹样。  字幕：  “第五道” “金纹醒来”   \n11.7—12.8秒  主镜头。  完成后的作品放在深色木质工作台上。  工匠用双手缓慢旋转检查。  没有任何戏剧表演。  只检查：  纹样， 漆面， 金箔， 边缘， 细节。  自然光已经明显进入工作室。  金色纹样被晨光照亮。  字幕：  “第六道” “最后一眼”   \n12.8—13.8秒  插入镜头。  作品被轻轻放入定制包装盒。  暖米色软布包裹器物。  盒盖缓慢合上。  手将包装盒推向画面前方。  纸张、 布料、 木盒均保持真实触感。  不要奢侈品浮夸包装。  字幕：  “第七道” “入盒”   \n13.8—15秒  最终镜头。  切到极简现代非遗精品店。  温暖自然晨光。  深色木制陈列架。  一只手将完成的漆线雕作品从画面侧面轻轻放到展示台中央。  手退出画面。  作品保持完全静止。  金色漆线在自然光中形成极精细的浮雕反光。  背景虚化。  最后0.6秒不再运动。  字幕：  “第八道” “上架”  画面中央仅允许出现一句极小的中文：  “厦门漆线雕”  下面更小：  “一线成雕”  最终画面必须像高端工艺品牌的静态产品摄影。  绝对不要继续运动。\n   \n【色彩】  整支影片限制在以下颜色：  陈年砖粉灰， 生漆深褐， 木质黑褐， 朱砂红， 暖米白， 金箔金。  影片前半段：  黑褐色占主导。  中段：  朱红逐渐出现。  后半段：  金色逐渐占据视觉中心。  禁止：  青蓝科技色， 霓虹， 紫色， 赛博朋克， 高饱和国潮配色。  金色必须来自真实金箔和真实光线。  不能使用发光特效制造金色。   \n\n【摄影】  全片使用真实人文纪录摄影语言。  大量：  100毫米微距镜头， 近距离手部特写， 极浅景深， 35毫米胶片颗粒。  摄影机运动非常少。  允许：  轻微呼吸感手持， 一次非常缓慢的轴向推进， 极细微的跟随动作。  禁止：  无人机， 环绕运镜， 快速推拉， 旋转镜头， 甩镜， 变焦冲击， 慢动作， 速度渐变， 镜头炫技。  镜头永远尊重手艺本身。   \n\n【声音】  全片没有任何音乐。  没有旁白。  没有人物对白。  没有广告配音。  只使用现场真实声音。  \n 0—3.3秒：  凌晨安静工作室。  远处非常轻的环境底噪。  漆线土落在木板上的闷响。  手掌揉压材料的湿润摩擦声。  搓板来回运动产生细密摩擦声。   3.3—8.6秒：  整体声音进一步降低。  细工具轻碰器物表面的声音。  手指移动。  漆线被放下时极轻微的黏连声音。  器物缓慢旋转时木架产生细小摩擦声。   8.6—10.2秒：  这是整支影片最重要的声音时刻。  其他环境声音全部压低。  只留下：  金箔极薄的纸张颤动声， 轻微呼吸， 工具触碰金箔的细小声音。  金箔落到漆线表面的瞬间，  接近安静。  让观众感觉自己离这张金箔只有几厘米。   10.2—12.8秒：  软毛刷扫过金箔。  细碎金箔摩擦。  器物在木架上轻轻旋转。   12.8—15秒：  包装纸折叠。  布料摩擦。  盒盖轻轻合上。  随后进入店铺：  作品底座接触木质展台，  “嗒”。  最后接近完全安静。  只保留非常微弱的室内环境声。   \n\n【核心视觉原则】  不要把它拍成：  “传统文化宣传片”。  要把它拍成：  “世界顶级手工艺品牌新品诞生纪录”。  传统来自材料和工艺，  高级感来自摄影、节奏和克制。\n   \n【禁止项】  不得出现任何与产品无关的文字。  不得出现旅游宣传标语。  不得出现：  “匠心传承” “非遗之美” “千年文化” “东方美学” 等泛化宣传口号。  不得出现不存在的历史年代。  不得出现虚假的皇宫或寺庙场景。  不得增加和尚、古装人物、舞狮、灯笼等所谓中国元素。  不得把漆线雕表现成木雕、石雕或刀刻。  重点必须明确表现：  搓线， 放线， 盘线， 绕线， 堆线， 贴金。  不得用三维特效让纹样自动生长。  不得让漆线自行移动。  所有纹样必须由人的手完成。  不得使用魔法粒子。  不得让金箔发光。  不得使用人工光晕。  不得使用慢动作。  不得加入速度渐变。  不得加入转场音效。  不得使用呼啸声。  不得出现手机界面。  不得出现电商界面。  不得出现价格。  不得出现二维码。  不得出现网站。  不得出现社交媒体账号。  不得出现水印。  不得增加第十个镜头。  最终画面完全静止。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSdXpBbUAE7_KY.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSdXpBaMAAClFN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPSdXpBbAAEJPJ3.jpg"]}];